OL,3,GNEWSABoy, 16, and 80-year-old man die
OL,4,Ain light aircraft crash near Loch
OL,5,ALomond
OL,6,
OL,7,FA 16-year-old boy and 80-year-old man
OL,8,Fhave died following a light aircraft
OL,9,Fcrash near Loch Lomond.
OL,11,FEmergency services were called to the
OL,12,Fscene of the crash near Drymen in
OL,13,FStirling at about 16:45 on Friday.
OL,15,FThe boy and man were pronounced dead
OL,16,Fand their next of kin have been made
OL,17,Faware, police said.
OL,19,FTemporary airspace restrictions are
OL,20,Fcurrently in place over the area while
OL,21,Fthe Air Accidents Investigation Branch
OL,22,F(AAIB) conduct their inquiries.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
